WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.310
It has been proposed that every university student should be required to take part in at least one research project.
有人提议，应当要求每个大学生至少参加一个科研项目。

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:17.960
In my view, the proposal is necessary, and it is also practical as long as it is carried out flexibly.
在我看来，这项提议是必要的，而且只要灵活实施，也是切实可行的。

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:24.120
The requirement is necessary because research teaches what ordinary classes seldom can.
这一要求之所以必要，是因为科研能教给学生普通课堂很少能教的东西。

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:32.960
When students design an experiment or conduct a survey, they learn to ask good questions, analyze data and solve problems on their own.
当学生设计实验或开展调查时，他们会学会提出好问题、分析数据，并独立解决问题。

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.100
Working with teachers and teammates also develops their communication skills and sense of responsibility.
与老师和队友合作还能培养他们的沟通能力和责任感。

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:46.000
These gains will benefit them whether they pursue further study or enter the job market.
无论他们是继续深造还是走上就业市场，这些收获都会让他们受益。

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.780
The proposal is also practical.
这项提议也是切实可行的。

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:59.660
Most universities already have laboratories, libraries and teachers engaged in research, so students can join existing projects instead of starting from scratch.
大多数大学已经有实验室、图书馆和从事科研的教师，因此学生可以加入现有的项目，而不必从零开始。

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:09.800
Projects can range from a small task in a professor’s experiment to a semester-long independent survey, allowing students of all majors to find a good fit.
项目可大可小，从教授实验中的一项小任务到持续一学期的独立调查都可以，这样各个专业的学生都能找到适合自己的项目。

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:17.480
With proper guidance and a reasonable schedule, research will be a valuable experience for students rather than a burden.
只要有恰当的指导和合理的安排，科研对学生来说将是一段宝贵的经历，而不是一种负担。
